--- Two tensors whose shapes do not meet stop the program with the same
--- words in both modes. Shapes the program states are refused before it
--- runs; shapes it computes meet at run time, where an element-wise
--- operation of shapes that do not broadcast stopped the interpreter with
--- a crash (a panic in the runtime) while the compiled program reported it.
use math
fn grid[k]
    return zeros[k, k]
log[len[grid[2] + ones[2]]]
log[len[grid[3] .* ones[3, 3]]]
log[grid[2] + grid[3]]
